{"availability":"available","full":"devsterxyz/Klick","name":"Klick","description":"A cursor click animation library for React and Next.js, sprinkle delightful click effects on any element with a single CLI command.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":66,"forks":6,"created":"2026-04-07T12:51:42Z","updated":"2026-09-04T18:36:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://klick-here.vercel.app","topics":["nextjs","registry","shadcn-ui"],"demo":"https://klick-here.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:54.057Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:54.057Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:54.057Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:01:00.266Z","stars":66,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:54.057Z","stars":66,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A cursor click animation library for React and Next.js, sprinkle delightful click effects on any element with a single CLI command.","Klick is a cursor click animation library for React and Next.js components or pages. Wrap any element, a button, a card, a whole page, and every click triggers a canvas-based animation like rain droplets, hearts, radiating lines, smoke puffs, and more. Components install with a single CLI command (powered by shadcn/ui), so the code lands directly in your project, fully typed and ready to customize."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devsterxyz/Klick/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6592046e440705f2254e500b5e0819bf28ace1d53618ff03e98f9069c9c25e8c","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:01:00.531Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:01:00.531Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A cursor click animation library for React and Next.js, sprinkle delightful click effects on any element with a single CLI command.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devsterxyz/Klick/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6592046e440705f2254e500b5e081